WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:16.219
Game of Thrones prequel series, House of the
Dragon, though based on the George RR Martin's

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:20.830
Targaryen history book Fire &amp; Blood, will
not feature Targaryens only but many other

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:25.369
houses and many other legendary figures from
that time period as well.

00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:28.880
From Lord Larys Strong who is pretty much
a combination of Varys and Littlefinger to

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:34.050
Alys Rivers who has the same abilities as
Melisandre and likely is Melisandre in her

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:39.620
younger days, to Nettles, a dragonseed, who
was either Daemon's secret child or his lover,

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.120
or even both.
We also have Cregan Stark, Roddy the Ruin

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.280
and his legendary Winter Wolfs.
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.190
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president
to air in 2022.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:57.039
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve
as showrunners and executive producers. George

00:00:57.039 --> 00:00:59.640
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive
producer.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:04.750
It is based on George RR Martin’s book Fire
And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s yet unfinished

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.920
Fire And Blood volume 2 book.
Fire And Blood is about long and rich history

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.820
of House Targaryen.
The key event of the show is also the key

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.320
in a history of House Targaryen, the Dance
of the Dragons - the Targaryen civil war,

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:22.369
which divided the entire kingdom and launched
a huge war that was fought from 129 AC to

00:01:22.369 --> 00:01:25.479
131 AC.
The Dance of the Dragons was the most devastating

00:01:25.479 --> 00:01:30.210
war in the history of the Seven Kingdoms.
A war of succession between Aegon II and his

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:34.380
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys
I's throne.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:38.299
Both of them thought they belonged on the
Iron Throne. When people started declaring

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:42.320
for one of them or the other, their fight
divided the kingdoms in two.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:47.770
Targaryens fought Targaryens, bothers fought
brothers, dragons fought dragons. By the time

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:52.479
it was over, thousands were dead.
Not Targaryens, but Northmen, Cregan Stark,

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:57.159
Roddy the Ruin and his Winter Wolves play
a big role in the Dance of the Dragons with

00:01:57.159 --> 00:02:00.030
Cregan even becoming the main character at
one point,

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:03.219
but for the most part he's legendary side
character.

00:02:03.219 --> 00:02:07.049
Cregan Stark, known as the Old Man of the
North, The Wolf of the North and The Wolf

00:02:07.049 --> 00:02:11.311
of Winterfell, was the Lord of Winterfell
and head of House Stark during the Targaryn

00:02:11.311 --> 00:02:14.250
civil war.
Before fighting someone else's war, Cregan

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:19.040
had to fight his own war to get what was rightfully
his, to take the rule of the North from his

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:22.980
uncle upon himself.
Three years before the Dance of the Dragons

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:28.560
started, in 126 AC, Cregan finally rose up
against his uncle, and imprisoned Bennard

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:33.120
and his three sons, taking the rule of the
north into his own hands.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.150
Upon the death of King Viserys I Targaryen,
Rhaenyra's son Prince Jacaerys Velaryon flew

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:42.569
to Winterfell on his dragon Vermax to gain
the support of the Starks and the north for

00:02:42.569 --> 00:02:46.069
his mother Rhaenyra Targaryen's claim to the
Iron Throne.

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:50.379
The alliance, known as the Pact of Ice and
Fire, stated that a Targaryen princess, the

00:02:50.379 --> 00:02:56.190
future firstborn daughter of Jacaerys, would
marry his son Rickon. Cregan pledged his support

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:00.959
to the blacks during the Dance of the Dragons.
After Prince Jacaerys Velaryon secured the

00:03:00.959 --> 00:03:06.019
allegiance of the North for his mother Rhaenyra
Targaryen, Lord Cregan Stark sent two thousand

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:11.030
soldiers known as the Winter Wolves south
commanded by his bannerman Lord Roderick Dustin

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:15.790
known as Roddy the Ruin to support the Queen's
claim while he remained in the North to gather

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:20.610
his own banners (due to the vastness of the
North this would take long).

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:25.690
By the start of the Dance of the Dragons,
Roderick was an old and hoary warrior.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:30.860
Despite his advanced age, he was still considered
a savage combatant on the battlefield.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.620
Roddy the Ruin wore a shield, a helm, and
warhorn in battle.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:39.850
The Winter Wolves were grizzled soldiers who
rode shaggy northern horses, wore old mail

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:45.700
and ragged skins and wielded axes, mauls,
spiked maces and ancient iron swords.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:50.660
''We have come to die for the dragon queen.''
said Lord Roderick while leading 2000 Winter

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:54.250
Wolfs into battle.
There is probably nothing scarier than fighting

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:58.069
men who have come to die.
During the Battle by the Lakeshore, the Winter

00:03:58.069 --> 00:04:03.379
Wolves led the attack and charged the Lannister
spearmen five times, with two thirds of the

00:04:03.379 --> 00:04:07.500
Northmen killed or wounded in their decisive
victory for the blacks.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:12.329
During the Butcher's Ball, Lord Roderick sounded
the charge of the Winter Wolves and their

00:04:12.329 --> 00:04:17.721
river knight allies against Ser Criston Criston's
army in the ensuing Butcher's Ball, a slaughter

00:04:17.721 --> 00:04:21.400
of the greens.
During the First Battle of Tumbleton, the

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:27.241
surviving Winter Wolves screamed northern
war cries and rode from a postern gate. Despite

00:04:27.241 --> 00:04:32.170
being outnumbered by ten to one, Roddy the
Ruin led the northmen in a charge against

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:36.800
Lord Ormund Hightower.
As the singers tell it, Roddy was blood from

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:41.789
head to heel as he came on, yet so drunk with
battle that he did not even seem to feel his

00:04:41.789 --> 00:04:45.010
wounds.
Lord Ormund's nephew, Ser Bryndon, was able

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:50.000
to cut off Roderick's shield arm with a longaxe,
but the nortern lord was able to kill both

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.800
Hightowers before succumbing to his wounds.
Rhaenyra fled King's Landing after the Storming

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:59.120
of the Dragonpit. While she was staying at
Duskendale, Lord Stark wrote that he would

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:04.070
gather for her a host of ten thousand northmen
younger and fiercer than the fallen Winter

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.650
Wolves.
Rhaenyra was killed at Dragonstone by King

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:11.810
Aegon II Targaryen, however, but Cregan with
his army still marched south nontheless in

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:17.020
support of her son, Prince Aegon the Younger.
He moved his forces to claim King's Landing

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:22.130
where he found that Aegon II had been poisoned
and Aegon III was now king.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:26.180
This event came to be known as the 'Hour of
the Wolf' or the 'Judgment of the Wolf' in

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.180
which Cregan ruled Kings Landing and brought
justice upon all the betrayers and turn cloaks.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:31.229
Speaking about betrayers, Larys Strong will
also be an epic side character in the upcoming

00:05:31.229 --> 00:05:36.190
prequel series. Larys Strong is a combination
of Varys and Littlefinger, being the one in

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:41.350
shadows, orchestrating many events and deaths
of powerful people, making kings rise and

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:45.340
fall.
Larys Strong, known as Larys Clubfoot or the

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:50.229
Clubfoot, was the Lord of Harrenhal and head
of House Strong. He served on the small council

00:05:50.229 --> 00:05:54.560
as the master of whisperers and Lord Confessor
for both kings.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:06:00.099
Larys rarely spoke, preferring to listen.
His older brother, Harwin the Strong is rumored

00:06:00.099 --> 00:06:05.220
to have fathered three of Rhaenyra's children.
Historians are still baffled as to exactly

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:10.430
what Clubfoot's loyalties and goals were during
the Dance of the Dragons as he sided with

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:15.070
Aegon, but at the end orchestrated his death.
Aside from possibly having his father and

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:19.690
brother killed to become lord of House Strong,
everything he does during the Targaryen civil

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:26.350
war is a mix of duty to the realm and self-preservation.
Like Varys, he stays loyal to his designated

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:31.170
monarch until that monarch threatens to bring
the realm down with him. Like Littlefinger,

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:36.270
he orchestrates that monarch's death once
he becomes too much of a problem, switches

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:40.620
sides and decides to create his own rule by
reigning through an underage ruler.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.760
Fortunes turned against Lord Strong and his
plotters with the arrival of the northern

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:50.311
army of Lord Cregan Stark, who served as Hand
of the King to the new King Aegon III Targaryen

00:06:50.311 --> 00:06:56.080
during the Hour of the Wolf. Despite having
been a supporter of Rhaenyra, Cregan objected

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.669
to the murder of Aegon II.
Grand Maester Orwyle confessed to having given

00:07:00.669 --> 00:07:05.649
Larys the poison used to kill Aegon,
and Ser Perkin confessed to being the Clubfoot's

00:07:05.649 --> 00:07:10.610
agent. While Lord Corlys admitted to having
conspired against Aegon for the good of the

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:17.070
Seven Kingdoms, Larys refused to confirm or
deny Cregan's accusations. Lord Stark condemned

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:22.761
both of the great lords, but Alysanne Blackwood
convinced him to spare Lord Velaryon. While

00:07:22.761 --> 00:07:26.450
most of those found guilty took the black
and joined the Night's Watch,

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:32.110
Lord Larys chose death over the Wall. Cregan
beheaded him with his Valyrian steel greatsword,

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.870
Ice.
Next we have Nettles who is believed to be

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:40.830
either Daemon's secret child or lover.
Nettles, also known as Netty, was a dragonseed

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:45.550
and the first and possibly last dragonrider
of the dragon Sheepstealer. Nettles was able

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:51.680
to tame the wild dragon Sheepstealer by bringing
it a freshly slaughtered sheep each morning.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:56.810
According to Mushroom, Daemon had come to
love the girl and took her as his bedmate.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:01.200
In contrast, the maester at Maidenpool where
the two stayed, stated the dragonriders had

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:06.700
separate bedrooms and that Daemon doted upon
Nettles "as a man might dote upon his daughter".

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:11.840
When Maester Norren informed Daemon that Rhaenyra
had declared Nettles a traitor, believing

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:16.860
all dragonseeds are traitors and believing
Nettles poisoned Daemon's mind, Daemon disobeyed

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:20.660
his queen and his wife's order and allowed
Nettles to escape.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:25.940
In her exile she went to the Vale of Arryn.
Last but not least we have Alys Rivers who's

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.630
origins are shrouded in mystery with some
believing she is Melisandre herself in her

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:34.719
younger days.
Alys looked unusually young for her age, as

00:08:34.719 --> 00:08:38.870
she had to be at least forty by the outbreak
of the Dance of the Dragons and some even

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:43.279
believe she was much older than that.
Alys Rivers was a bedmate of Prince Aemond

00:08:43.279 --> 00:08:47.340
Targaryen. Like Melisandre, she saw visions
in fire,

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:51.510
thats how Aemond learned that Daemon was waiting
for him in Harrenhal.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:56.140
When Prince Aemond flew back to Harrenhal
to do battle with Prince Daemon and Caraxes,

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:01.400
he took the pregnant Alys with him. Aemond
told Daemon that it was Alys who told him

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.780
where to find him, as she saw a vision in
a fire.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:09.490
After Daemon killed Aemond, Alys became the
witch queen, ruling Harrenhal.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:14.750
The Hand of the King at the time, Ser Tyland
Lannister, tasked Ser Regis Groves of the

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:20.840
Kingsguard and Ser Damon Darry with reclaiming
the castle and gave them one hundred men.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:25.500
Instead of yielding, Alys presented them a
young boy as Aemond's trueborn son and the

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:32.080
rightful king instead of Aegon III Targaryen.
Regis abruptly died after insulting Alys.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:37.510
Eye witnesses claim she used magic to burst
his skull. Alys's rabble then rode from Harrenhal

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:42.190
and overwhelmed the loyalist men,
with Damon fleeing with the remaining men.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:46.970
Alys sent a captured loyalist as a messenger
the following day. The survivor claimed that

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:51.990
he had been cursed by Alys so that he would
die if anyone laughed at his story. He said

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:57.570
Alys had instructed him that any man who approached
Harrenhal without submitting to its occupants

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:03.320
would die. The man also insisted that he had
seen a dragon inside. Despite Damon's assurance

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:08.740
that no one would laugh at the messenger's
story, one onlooker did so. The messenger

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:13.140
then choked to death in moments, with some
saying they had seen the imprints of a woman's

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:18.430
fingers on his throat. Her story will continue
when George RR Martin finishes Fire And Blood

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.400
volume 2.
Legendary side characters such as Cregan Stark,

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:27.710
Roddy the Ruin, Nettles, Larys and Alys, legendary
battles such as the Winter Wolfs' charge into

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:32.730
the Greens army despite being outnumbered
by ten to one and managing to reach the commander

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:37.580
of the greens, and seeing a Stark rule the
capital Kings Landing, all of that and more

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:41.280
this Game of Thrones prequel show, House of
the Dragon, brings in 2022.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.431
Thank you so much for watching, hope you enjoyed
this video and if you did make sure to give

00:10:44.431 --> 00:10:52.450
it a big thumbs up and I hope to see you in
the next one, peace!

